{"3531260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Superhero Simulator", "steam_appid": 3531260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4013180], "detailed_description": "<h1>FULL RELEASE COMING SOON!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/77665860a2f6455043390685ed9d6c12.avif?t=1784570055\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras_big/77665860a2f6455043390685ed9d6c12.avif?t=1784570055 width=1560 height=728 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to protect your city? In <strong>Superhero Simulator</strong>, take on the rising crime rate as you patrol the streets, stop robberies, rescue civilians, and battle powerful villains. <strong>Your choices shape the city!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a1a8dc9e63c199925da81d665a6f9732.poster.avif?t=1784570055\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a1a8dc9e63c199925da81d665a6f9732.webm?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a1a8dc9e63c199925da81d665a6f9732.mp4?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVE THE CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop robberies, rescue civilians, and fight crime your way. Every heroic act unlocks new abilities - become the hero <strong>Goldpine</strong> needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/ca43c9ae022bfef84b4019abf91ad0a9.poster.avif?t=1784570055\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/ca43c9ae022bfef84b4019abf91ad0a9.webm?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/ca43c9ae022bfef84b4019abf91ad0a9.mp4?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR DAILY NEEDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a hero doesn’t pay the bills—so you’ll <strong>need a job to survive. Drive a taxi, flip burgers, or find other ways</strong> to <strong>earn money</strong>  Every <strong>&quot;Gollar&quot;</strong> counts, whether it’s for food, or upgrading your gear. <strong>Balance your heroic duties with everyday struggles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a7319831266b5a1c4777c52d84308c3b.poster.avif?t=1784570055\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a7319831266b5a1c4777c52d84308c3b.webm?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a7319831266b5a1c4777c52d84308c3b.mp4?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR HERO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your perfect superhero AND civilian identity! Mix and match masks, capes, and armor sets to create your signature look. Your hero, your style, your legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/7e4d2ce39fd02b38c9f39b3c148e9383.poster.avif?t=1784570055\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/7e4d2ce39fd02b38c9f39b3c148e9383.webm?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/7e4d2ce39fd02b38c9f39b3c148e9383.mp4?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RISE OR FALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your <strong>health, hygiene, mental state, and respect</strong> to stay at your best. Neglect them, and your journey becomes harder. Every action shapes your legend—will you rise or break under the pressure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/62d6dafdcdc2ceddc7dc3fd5abcb29ae.poster.avif?t=1784570055\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/62d6dafdcdc2ceddc7dc3fd5abcb29ae.webm?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/62d6dafdcdc2ceddc7dc3fd5abcb29ae.mp4?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to protect your city? In <strong>Superhero Simulator</strong>, take on the rising crime rate as you patrol the streets, stop robberies, rescue civilians, and battle powerful villains. <strong>Your choices shape the city!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta